{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_chat_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "7cef41290cce0bcd33caa1f9108208fce16b485d2ca665d140aa493facbbc905", "ja": "昨日、お姉ちゃんと一緒に\n見たドラマ、面白かったなぁ♪", "zh": "昨天跟姊姊一起看的那出电视剧，\n剧情实在好趣喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_chat_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "14c4f42d2ea2c2b895a93646e6b7ebd91c95e1569b775bdefec1e16bffc3c330", "ja": "でもお姉ちゃん、いつもお仕事で\n帰りが遅いから、録画がどんどん\nたまっていくんだよね……。", "zh": "但姊姊老是工作晚归，\n录了却没空看的节目越积越多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_chat_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "f4e1d7d3e3f58b1ffd098e20d073e583027fd1a451dc2c24201b16447f2be543", "ja": "よ～し！　今度の週末は、\n2人で1日中ドラマを観る日に\nしようっと♪", "zh": "好～！就决定这个周末一整天，\n来两个人一起追剧吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0032_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_chat_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "529bc85f69642f267cea1d89fa8efa9cd96a49484ea58cae1a1071b239531f72", "ja": "お菓子は、劇場の売店で\n買っておけばいいよね？\n種類もたくさんあるし……。", "zh": "零食在剧场的贩卖部买就好了吧？\n反正那里选择很多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
